      <Placemark>
        <name>Zagreb (Croacia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[2 plazas de 5 meses <br>Estudios: Grado<br>1 Plaza de 5 meses.<br>Estudios: Máster<br><br>Coordinadora: Dra. Concepción Arenas Abad<br>Nivel de Idioma: Obligatorio B2 inglés<br><br>Información Adicional:<br>http://www.unizg.hr/homepage/international-exchange/exchange-students/before-coming-to-zagreb/<br>http://www.unizg.hr/homepage/study-at-the-university-of-zagreb/academic-information/the-ects-system-and-student-progress-assessment/]]></description>
