      <Placemark>
        <name>Savoie, Chamberi (Francia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[4 plazas de 10 meses.<br>Estudios: Alumnos 3º y 4º Grado (no TFG)  y Máster.<br>Coordinadora: Dra. Mª Teresa Román Berdiel.<br>Requisitos de Idioma: <br>French – B2 level is required to attend classes in French<br>If the student has B1 level when applying, he/she needs to attend the integration week as well as the French course during the semester<br>Información Adicional:<br>https://www.univ-smb.fr/fileadmin/Dri/UDS_grading_system/UDS_grading-system.pdf<br>Incoming.students@univ-smb.fr]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-168</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            5.916819,45.567104,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Grenoble (Francia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[4 plazas de 10 meses (compartido con Grado en Fisica).<br>Estudios: Alumnos 4º curso Grado y Máster<br>Coordinador: Dra. Blanca Bauluz Lázaro.<br>Requisitos de Idioma: Recomendado B1 francés; B2 inglés<br><br>Información Adicional:<br>http://www.ujf-grenoble.fr/formation/diplomes/<br>http://www.ujf-grenoble.fr/medias/fichier/welcomeguide-2013-2014-english_1370349557576.pdf<br>Grading System<br>18-20= very uncommon. Brilliant and exceptional results<br>16-18=outstanding performance first rate results<br>14-16=very good to excellent results<br>12-14=Good to very good results//10-12=Passing to satisfactory/ <10=Fail, further work required]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-168</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            5.762358,45.19287,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Pau (Francia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[2 plazas de 9 meses<br>Estudios: Grado y Máster.<br>Coordinador: Dr. Antonio Casas Sáinz.<br>Nivel de Idioma: aceptado B1 francés, recomendado B2 francés<br><br>Información Adicional<br>http://ri.univ-pau.fr/live/course_catalogue<br>http://ri.univ-pau.fr/live/practical_information/visa_residence_permit<br>http://ri.univ-pau.fr/live/digitalAssets/121/121704_Guide_International.pdf<br>http://ri.univ-pau.fr/live/practical_information/insurance<br>http://ri.univ-pau.fr/live/exchange_programmes/erasmus/accommodation<br>http://ri.univ-pau.fr/live/validation_mobility]]></description>
